# Room, Kotlin metadata, Hilt, Compose, and AndroidX FileProvider ship
# consumer keep rules in their AARs. Manual copies of those library rules are
# redundant and stop R8 from optimizing generated database accessors.
# https://developer.android.com/topic/performance/app-optimization/enable-app-optimization
#
# Add app-specific rules here only when a minified release build proves they
# are required.
